            3.99
      &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;/td&gt;
  &lt;/tr&gt;
  &lt;tr&gt;
    &lt;td colspan="2"&gt;&lt;h2 style="text-align: center;"&gt;Taste pure bliss with Cadbury Chocolate!&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Get ready for an irresistible serving of Cadbury chocolate! The Cadbury Dairy Milk Hazelnut Creme is rich and enticing and filled with the crunch of hazelnuts!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As you take that first bite, your shoulders will fall back, and you'll begin to feel overwhelmed with a sort of happiness that only chocolate can provide. Everything will be right with the world as you happily taste rich, creamy Dairy Milk chocolate stuffed with hazelnut creme and embedded with tiny, crunchy hazelnut bits. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is the kind of chocolate bar that dreams are made of! Serving up the iconic Cadbury chocolate, nothing can top this. Those hazelnuts highlight the rich, deep flavours and are perfect against the smooth, silky dairy milk chocolate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leave your troubles behind and taste pure joy with Cadbury Dairy Milk Hazelnut Creme!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;105g&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
  &lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;

    </description>
