    &lt;/td&gt;
  &lt;/tr&gt;
  &lt;tr&gt;
    &lt;td colspan="2"&gt;&lt;h2 style="text-align: center;"&gt;The only Halloween chocolate bars you'll need!&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Trick or treat? You know us; we always say treat! The Mars Halloween chocolate Variety is just what the spooky season calls for! A sweet selection of mini-sized bars.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Okay, we know these might not reach those cute little trick-or-treaters, and we can't blame you. These delcioius little gems always find a way into our hearts and mouths! This selection includes mini Mars bars, mini Twix bars, mini Snickers bars, and, of course, M&amp;amp;M's!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We do suggest getting a box and pouring them into a big bowl for Halloween night. But let's be honest, they won't last that long! We recommend buying a few more, just to make sure you have enough Halloween candy to hand out to those little ghosts and goblins and also treat yourself!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Make it the happiest Halloween ever with the classic Mars Halloween Chocolate Variety!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;50ct - 526g&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
